  "title": "Quick Roasted Mexican Callaloo Chiles Rellenos",
  "description": "A roasted, snappy, crowd-pleaser Mexican dish featuring callaloo, this recipe is an anti-inflammatory friendly version of traditional chiles rellenos, with a mantecare-emulsify twist.",
