  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Roast poblano peppers in the oven for 20 minutes, or until the skin is blistered and charred.",
    "Peel the roasted poblano peppers and remove the seeds and membranes.",
    "In a pan, heat olive oil over medium heat and saute onion and garlic until softened.",
    "Add chopped callaloo to the pan and cook until wilted.",
    "Stuff each roasted poblano pepper with the callaloo mixture and top with queso fresco.",
    "Place the stuffed peppers in a baking dish and bake for 15 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
